# snippetbox

Card previews for snippetbox.

excerpt(text, limit) returns a short preview. If the text is at most limit characters it is returned unchanged. If it is longer, it is cut at a word boundary at or before the limit and a single-character ellipsis is appended. The ellipsis appears only when text was actually removed.

## Markdown

toPlain(markdown) flattens a markdown body to plain text before it is excerpted: markers removed, links reduced to their text, runs of whitespace collapsed.

